Test data (tests/fixtures/):
- Synthetic fixtures are generated by tests/fixtures/tools/generate_fixtures.py and are part of Kitab (AGPL-3.0-or-later).
- tests/fixtures/pdf/certs/ holds throwaway test keys with password "kitab". They are not secret and must never be trusted outside tests.
- tests/fixtures/rar/libarchive-*.rar are libarchive's RAR test archives, Copyright (c) the libarchive authors. BSD-2-Clause (tests/fixtures/rar/LICENSE-libarchive.txt).
- tests/fixtures/other/11-scan-cyrillic.djvu is a public-domain scan (Simonovich, 1905, from the Internet Archive, via djvu-rs's test corpus).
- Other real-world fixtures are not committed. tools/fetch_real_world.py downloads them; their sources and licences are listed there.

App and document icons (assets/brand, packaging/): drawn for Kitab (AGPL-3.0-or-later, like the code). Their format labels use Nimbus Sans Bold, from MuPDF's built-in fonts (URW++, released under the GNU AGPL with MuPDF).
